# No environment variables are required for the normal desktop app.
#
# Configure API keys, model settings, Tavily, Telegram bot token, and Telegram
# allowlist in the desktop app Settings.
#
# Backend-only runs may still use .env values supported by app.config.Settings
# when there is no desktop Settings UI available.
#
# Browser-only development requires an explicit control-plane token:
# MONAW_CONTROL_SECRET=<at least 32 random characters>
# MONAW_ALLOW_DEVELOPMENT_TOKEN=1
# VITE_MONAW_CONTROL_TOKEN=<same value, supplied to the Vite process>
